        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Amber Heard, Mamie Gummer, Danielle Panabaker, Jared Harris, Laura-Leigh\n- Works: The Ward, Mad Men, Fringe, The Crown, The Expanse, We're the Millers, The Client List\n- Roles: actor, series regular character\n\nFacts:\n- Jared Francis Harris was born on 24 August 1961 and is an English actor.\n- Jared Harris is known for playing Lane Pryce in the AMC drama series \"Mad Men\".\n- Jared Harris is known for playing David Robert Jones in the Fox science-fiction series \"Fringe\".\n- Jared Harris is known for playing King George VI in the Netflix Original historical series \"The Crown\".\n- Jared Harris is known for playing Anderson Dawes in the Syfy science-fiction series \"The Expanse\".\n- The film \"The Ward\" stars Amber Heard, Mamie Gummer, Danielle Panabaker, and Jared Harris.\n- Laura-Leigh is known for roles in \"We're the Millers\" and \"The Ward\".\n- Laura-Leigh was a series regular character in the TV series \"The Client List\".",
